{"id":"sh/jilcvyds","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":64,"top":222,"width":698,"height":308},"text":"H_file = SHA256(M)\nM = PDF file bytes (no text extraction)\n\nPadding: M || 1 || 0^k || len64(M)\n(len(M) + 1 + k) mod 512 = 448\n\nW[t] = sigma1(W[t-2]) + W[t-7]\n     + sigma0(W[t-15]) + W[t-16]\nT1 = h + Sigma1(e) + Ch(e,f,g) + K[t] + W[t]\nT2 = Sigma0(a) + Maj(a,b,c)\n32-bit additions are modulo 2^32.\n\nOutput: 32 bytes = 64 hexadecimal characters","style":{"fontSize":19.51,"typeface":"Consolas","color":"#202C3C","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
